This means that the R process exited before Shiny ever got far enough to start listening for requests. You can write messages to stderr (for example: cat("Got here", file=stderr()) ) and those messages should be written out to the error page as well; if you sprinkle these in your startup code it should help you pinpoint where the failure is occurring.

