MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Note that if you are using the HTML UI, you need to explicitly include the slide js files in the head of the document.

<script type='text/javascript' src='shared/slider/js/jquery.slider.min.js <https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/master/inst/www/shared/slider/js/jquery.slider.min.js>'></script>

I am assuming that you already include jquery.js and shiny.js

You will also need to add a link to the css in the head of the document

<link rel="stylesheet" href="shared/slider/css/jquery.slider.min.css <https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/master/inst/www/shared/slider/css/jquery.slider.min.css>">

Hope this helps.

