Subject: Switch to a tab when selectInput value changed
Message-ID: <ZwnorkQSiMc.cBhE0VamVcAJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/shiny-discuss/c/ZwnorkQSiMc/m/cBhE0VamVcAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
