Sorry, you won't be able to use mysql on spark. It's not feasible for us to support spark as a mysql server, and it would be a bad idea to allow your mysql server to accept connections from a remote machine like spark.

If you want to use sqlite, you should be able to install the R package RSQLite on spark. I've also installed the sqlite and sqlite3 packages so you can access it from the command shell.

-Winston

