The code for includeHTML is trivial, it's just a readLines() call wrapped in an HTML(). If that's the only holdup you could easily just do it yourself.

myIncludeHTML <- function(path) {
  return(HTML(paste(readLines(path, warn=FALSE, encoding='UTF-8'), collapse='\r\n')))
}

